eligibility.criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Clinically diagnosed DKD;
* Age 18-70 years;
* eGFR ≥30 mL/min/1.73 m² (CKD-EPI equation);
* UACR ≥200 mg/g on two or more occasions within 3 months;
* Stable treatment with ACEI/ARB for ≥3 months;
* If taking SGLT2 inhibitors or non-steroidal MRAs, stable use for ≥4 weeks and continued throughout the study;
* If taking other herbal medicines for kidney disease (e.g., Huangkui Capsule), must continue stable use;
* Willingness to participate and signed informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* eGFR \<30 mL/min/1.73 m² or dialysis/transplant;
* Severe liver dysfunction, active systemic autoimmune diseases (e.g., lupus, Sjögren's), recent chemotherapy/radiotherapy;
* Cognitive impairment;
* Pregnancy or breastfeeding;
* Participation in another clinical trial;
* Any condition deemed unsuitable by the investigator.
